{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"还说不清\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里有股不肯停的劲，整个人还没缓过神来，连自己在等什么、舍不得什么都说不清。\",\n      \"key\": \"不肯停的劲\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕一松劲就垮下去，便逼自己撑住，心里却也想停一停，怕真投进去会失去别的东西。\",\n      \"key\": \"投进去会失去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"text\": \"那股劲一起来，熟悉的感觉也跟着回来，身体先想往前，可过去回不来。\",\n      \"key\": \"过去回不来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他想找理由说服自己往前，刚觉得想通，舍不得又回来，连那点确信也靠不住，他为非得想透才动而难堪。\",\n      \"key\": \"非得想透才动\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R1\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留无名推动力，补足身心尚未安顿、说不清等待与不舍的对象，解释无名失落和恍惚，不替他给不安命名。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R2\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去把不行动等同认可现状的无依据判断，保留不愿垮下去、想停一停和怕投入后失去的两难，也留下后来害怕争取耗尽温柔的起点。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R1\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"补写\",\n      \"why\": \"补入熟悉感回返、身体先有向前牵引而过去不能复得的心理变化，解释B4；不把旧场景写成真实往事，也不把身体的牵引写成已经作出的决定。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R3\", \"R4\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把寻找理由与刚有确信又被不舍打断收成一个求证循环，保留确信靠不住的动摇、对自己非得想透才肯行动的难堪，为后面不再以没想清楚为由继续等待留下明确前因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "258fd306-1c7a-49c6-a7b6-e5db0bf74eae", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T011335880811Z", "elapsed_seconds": 123.078, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:15:38.966291+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "491199a1de5994d9581e5e2a221225fb0489786082578185dbe1c57afa6b865f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T011335880811Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "870222d60bfba74990967ddb80a35fd958e9e7d185876f23e2b7fa4bcc1d2db2"}}}
